    "description": "Metalog is a repository of manually curated metadata for metagenomic sequencing data from across the globe, providing comprehensive contextual data for human, animal, ocean, and environmental samples. The database facilitates cross-study comparisons and meta-analyses by providing consistent annotation and linking to genome-based analyses.",
